a:1:{s:59:"../../../lib/Exception/MergeJobStoreUnreadableException.php";a:1:{i:0;O:49:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode":10:{s:55:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀name";s:53:"OCA\Filinq\Exception\MergeJobStoreUnreadableException";s:57:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀phpDoc";O:50:"PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode":4:{s:64:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀phpDocString";s:1210:"/**
 * A read of the merge job store that failed, rather than one that found nothing.
 *
 * 🔴 THIS EXCEPTION EXISTS BECAUSE THE TWO ANSWERS LOOKED THE SAME. The store
 * swallowed a read failure into `null`, and `null` means "there is no merge
 * with that id". So a register that was down, or a schema that did not
 * resolve, reached the polling caller as a 404: the person watching a queued
 * merge was told their merge did not exist, while it sat in the queue. The
 * client then stops polling, because a merge that is gone is not coming back.
 *
 * 🔑 IT IS NOT THROWN FOR A GENUINE ABSENCE. An id nobody ever queued still
 * reads as `null`, and still answers 404, because that is a true answer.
 *
 * The queue read raises for the same reason from the other side: an empty
 * queue and an unreadable queue both made MergeDocumentsJob report a clean
 * run over a queue it never saw.
 *
 * @category Exception
 * @package  OCA\Filinq\Exception
 * @author   Conduction B.V. <info@conduction.nl>
 * @license  EUPL-1.2 https://joinup.ec.europa.eu/collection/eupl/eupl-text-eupl-12
 * @link     https://www.filinq.app
 *
 * @spec openspec/changes/merge-documents-to-pdf/specs/document-merge/spec.md
 */";s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀namespace";s:20:"OCA\Filinq\Exception";s:56:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀uses";a:1:{s:16:"runtimeexception";s:16:"RuntimeException";}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedPhpDocNode␀constUses";a:0:{}}s:59:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀abstract";b:0;s:56:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀final";b:0;s:58:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀extends";s:16:"RuntimeException";s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀implements";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀usedTraits";a:0:{}s:70:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀traitUseAdaptations";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀statements";a:0:{}s:61:"␀PHPStan\Dependency\ExportedNode\ExportedClassNode␀attributes";a:0:{}}}}6811
